        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-5INtO7MFlm9PT9ORttEHZnht2GPh58J2ih5ZdTB1uFzf0DP4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Francis/Jessie and team provided excellent communication throughout the process. Their onsite pre-inspection was very thorough, even verifying that the cedar installation would not affect the underground electrical lines and pipes in Bois-Franc in Ville Saint-Laurent.  Pricing was very competitive, and they efficiently installed 24 feet of cedars in just one afternoon. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1760713523,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alannah Bougie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115323882167297797142/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJjBpbrYqtKNONUfYlbgTjBSJv5CxdbIT0tajBTNZv8mT3n_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Purcedres did an amazing job on our cèdres!!!\nIt was the whole yard both sides, and they were so professional and understanding when I’d change my mind a few times, for the front ones!\nThey cleaned up everything.\nWe are extremely happy!\nBefore and after photos!",
        "time": 1698691123,
        "translated": false
      },
